<title>USA: Fremont, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Fremont, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $6.155 million of Fremont, Calif., certificates of paarticipation, with a true interest cost of 5.95 percent.</p>
</text>
